# C4 (production's qwen3.5-9b-64k, from the official GGUF instead of MLX; A15 platform deviation). A15.2: production's Modelfile parameters (the Mac's qwen3.5-9b-64k: num_ctx 65536 and its sampling),
# over the official GGUF pinned by digest in pins.json. Only FROM differs between C4 and H1-H3.
FROM qwen3.5:9b
PARAMETER num_ctx 65536
PARAMETER min_p 0
PARAMETER presence_penalty 1.5
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1
PARAMETER temperature 1
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
